{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roguelike <span class=\"bb_strike\">Deckbuilder</span> Dicebuilder</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your path on the map and increase your power! Add new dice, level them up, pick up items, get some gold... every choice will get you closer to the end, and maybe to victory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reroll strategy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every animal dice has its use, you can still reroll them when you don\u2019t like their faces. Master all their elemental powers (Water, Fire, Life, Darkness\u2026) to battle the corrupted plants. Choose wisely what abilities you use during your turn, and maybe you'll survive to see your next one.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect them all</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new animals between runs and complete your collection! Get a cat, a bee, or maybe a dragon?!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4072320?t=1771871994","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072320/94659e4a7530394eaf160ca6e423c5adecc1de02/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771871994","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072320/7a4d839d7d92d707629af86314ca447442f88c86/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771871994","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072320/7a4d839d7d92d707629af86314ca447442f88c86/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771871994","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":41